<title>FRANCE: France to sell 22 to 24 bln Ffr of BTANs Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 22 to 24 bln Ffr of BTANs Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 22 and 24 billion francs of government bonds (BTANs) at its next scheduled auction on February 20, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Treasury will offer a new five-year benchmark, the 4.75 percent March 12, 2002 BTAN with a payment date of March 12.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
